@page "/account/reset-requested"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Check your inbox";
}
<h1>Check your inbox</h1>
<p>If the address belongs to an account, we have sent an email with the next step. A password reset link is valid for 30 minutes.</p>
<p>Nothing arrived after a few minutes? <a href="/account/forgot-password">Request a new link</a>.</p>
